:name: nucleo-h743zi
:description: NuttX on the nucleo-h743zi. Console on sysbus.usart3, connected to the NTFC terminal.

using sysbus
mach create "nucleo-h743zi"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/nucleo_h753zi.repl

$bin?=@nuttx

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset

connector Connect sysbus.usart3 ntfc
